{"id":"vencido","lemma":"vencido","pos":"adj","rank":2749,"glosses":["defeated, beaten","expired"],"ipa":"/benˈθido/","forms":{"feminine":"vencida","masculinePlural":"vencidos","femininePlural":"vencidas"},"examples":[{"text":"¿Jamás te das por vencido?","en":"Don't you ever give up?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460887","words":[{"g":"never"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"for / by"},null]},{"text":"Nos han vencido.","en":"We've been defeated.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/630268","words":[{"g":"us"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null]},{"text":"No nos podemos dar por vencidos ahora.","en":"We can't give up now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453901","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"us"},{"g":"to prune","l":"podar"},{"g":"to give, to give out"},{"g":"for / by"},null,{"g":"now"}]},{"text":"No me puedo dar por vencido ahora.","en":"I can't give up now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449009","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to give, to give out"},{"g":"for / by"},null,{"g":"now"}]},{"text":"Se dio por vencido.","en":"He gave up.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/523281","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"for / by"},null]}]}